<title>LEBANON: Lebanon money market rates - Banks Association.</title>
<headline>Lebanon money market rates - Banks Association.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following money market details on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Market in Lebanese pounds:</p>
<p>						  May 97   Apr 97   Mar 97</p>
<p>     Average rate on Deposits (%)     12.53    12.60     12.87</p>
<p>     Estimated interest spread	   3.86    3.99	 3.91</p>
<p>NOTE:Estimated interest spread does not take into account</p>
<p>operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>Market in Foreign Exchange:</p>
<p>     Average rate on Deposits (%)	5.66     5.60	5.48</p>
<p>     Estimated interest spread	   3.41     3.53	3.56</p>
<p>NOTE:Estimated interest spread does not take into account</p>
<p>operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>-- Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057  745307  745308</p>
</text>
